From: DCP design agent (omarchy-m5 / m5pro-linux)
Subject: [PATCH] firmware: recognise the 27.1 and 27.2 beta iBoot strings seen on J716s

The J716s stub (build 26C5035r) reports mBoot-20457.60.65.0.1, which is not
in the table, so os_firmware is V_UNKNOWN (log: "OS FW version: unknown").
V_UNKNOWN sorts below V15_0B1, so display_configure()'s "unsupported
firmware, skipping configuration" guard does not fire: if a boot ever takes
one of display_init()'s reconfigure branches (external display at boot,
dummy framebuffer), m1n1 would drive a 27.x DCP with its 13.x-era iBoot
protocol. Recognised, the version is >= V15_0B1 and m1n1 leaves DCP alone.

It also makes apple,firmware-version / asahi,os-fw-version meaningful for
the kernel (drm/apple prints them when it declines the DCP).

Version labels are inferred: 26C = the x.2 line (25C = 26.2) and the .60
iBoot train is the x.2 beta train (26.2 beta = 13822.60.24.x); .41 is the
x.1 release train. Confirm with the stub's SystemVersion.plist.

Base: ~/Work/m1n1 m5-t6050 459a3af2 (also applies to AsahiLinux/m1n1 main
70757dc7).
---
diff --git a/src/firmware.c b/src/firmware.c
index f597c05c..f421daaa 100644
--- a/src/firmware.c
+++ b/src/firmware.c
@@ -208,6 +208,13 @@ const struct fw_version_info fw_versions[NUM_FW_VERSIONS] = {
     [V26_7]      = {V26_7,      "26.7",        {26, 7, 0},     3, "mBoot-18000.161.10.701.1"},
     [V26_7_1]    = {V26_7_1,    "26.7.1",      {26, 7, 1},     3, "mBoot-18000.161.10.702.1"},
     [V27_0]      = {V27_0,      "27.0",        {27, 0, 0},     3, "mBoot-20457.1.29"},
+    // The next two are observed on a J716s (T6050), not taken from a release list.
+    // 20457.41.x: ADT firmware-version of the host macOS (the .41 train is the
+    // x.1 release in every 26.x/27.x pairing above).
+    [V27_1]      = {V27_1,      "27.1",        {27, 1, 0},     3, "mBoot-20457.41.2"},
+    // 20457.60.65.0.1: the paired stub of build 26C5035r. Build letter C and the
+    // .60 train both mean the x.2 beta line (26.2 beta: 13822.60.24.x).
+    [V27_2B]     = {V27_2B,     "27.2 beta",   {27, 1, 98, 1}, 4, "mBoot-20457.60.65.0.1"},
     // clang-format on
 };
 
diff --git a/src/firmware.h b/src/firmware.h
index 67b8d05d..ae1dcb97 100644
--- a/src/firmware.h
+++ b/src/firmware.h
@@ -191,6 +191,8 @@ enum fw_version {
     V26_7,
     V26_7_1,
     V27_0,
+    V27_1,
+    V27_2B,
     NUM_FW_VERSIONS,
 };
 
